WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.773
Open Prompt: the first message, then each section

00:00:04.773 --> 00:00:06.818
Interruptible: callers can talk over the first message

00:00:06.818 --> 00:00:10.051
Edit the first message

00:00:10.051 --> 00:00:12.650
Edit a prompt section

00:00:12.650 --> 00:00:17.271
Type @ to insert a variable, tool or knowledge base

00:00:17.271 --> 00:00:21.698
Mention an on-call tool so the agent uses it

00:00:21.698 --> 00:00:25.190
No match? Create the variable from the menu

00:00:25.190 --> 00:00:36.387
Logic → If Condition: text that applies only sometimes

00:00:36.387 --> 00:00:39.678
Select text: format, find and replace, or translate

00:00:39.678 --> 00:00:43.360
Find and replace works across every section

00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:48.861
Translate converts a selection to the secondary language

00:00:48.861 --> 00:00:50.921
Unsaved edits swap Test assistant for Discard and Save

00:00:50.921 --> 00:00:53.729
Click Save (or press Cmd+S)

00:00:53.729 --> 00:00:57.464
Saved: Test assistant is back in the top bar
